<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - March 4.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - March 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on March 4:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		   Ship	  Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Salt	     5,209/--- (LDD)   ---/3,306 Biu Ryu Gang    01/03</p>
<p>General	    136/--- (LDD)   ---/   85 Tiger Creek     03/03</p>
<p>General	     14/--- (ULD)   ---/  --- Progress Lily   03/03</p>
<p>Rock Phos	2,350/--- (ULD) 5,250/---   Kaptin Kissa    02/03</p>
<p>Coal	    26,833/--- (ULD) 4,700/---   APJ Akhil	 02/03</p>
<p>Dun Peas	   845/--- (ULD)16,000/---   Gomain Naree    02/03</p>
<p>Naphtha	    845/--- (ULD)16,000/---   Jag Pallak	04/03</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
